title: Remove the stale pallet-people, pallet-dummy-dim, and pallet-origin-restriction crates
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet-people`, `pallet-dummy-dim`, and `pallet-origin-restriction` are unused: development
    of pallet-people continued in `paritytech/individuality-community`, and nothing in this repo
    or in `polkadot-fellows/runtimes` depends on any of the three anymore. Removes all three.
crates: []
